Z||000001||theogre||03-06-2001||07:49 PM||||battery cables and/or ground straps bad/missing/loose could do that.||||reg||1
Z||000002||pontiacs4me||03-06-2001||08:57 PM||||check the red wires that run together under the wire harness block on the passenger side of the engine compartment by the battery.  I had the top one come a little loose and the whole car shut down.  Take the whole deal apart and clean everything metal real good with a wire brush and put it all back together.  I'll bet that is the problem.||||reg||1
